      },
      {
        tag: "unit",
        id: "STONE-HEART",
        type: "Great Stone Golem",
        side: 2,
        x: 9,
        y: 4,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "carryover_14",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "carryover_percentage",
            value: 100,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "ai_grouping",
            value: "offensive",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "ai_directives",
            value: "goal,,,0,5,%7B%22side%22%3A1%7D",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_15",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "revelation.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("<i>_Dwarves are a very cautious folk, carefully guarding their secrets.</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_16",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("<i>_They are well known for frantically mining treasures and adorning themselves with jewels. Less well known is that they practice a mysterious kind of magic.</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_17",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("<i>_It is said that when the earliest dwarves first came up from the deep, they left behind a primordial power far below. Through the art of runes, dwarves create energy channels that carry fragments of this power up to the surface world.</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_18",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("<i>_Descending deeper through the trapdoor, Ougl became the first of the Golden Flame Tribe to see this art in action.</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "loyal_19",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            units: "OL,STONE-HEART,STONE-HEART",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "objectives",
        side: 1,
        victory: _("Reach the artifact (10,2)"),
        defeat: _("Death of Ougl"),
      },
